{"unit_id":"ENDDREAM-ZM__dsh-qq-voice#card-zh","repo":"ENDDREAM-ZM/dsh-qq-voice","commit":"f870405ea35856ba8bb82a4549e5cb7dabdd3a79","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-voice 是面向 DSH 的 QQ 语音插件，通过 OneBot v11 接收消息并注册语音合成工具。它可把文字合成为语音条，支持普通话、粤语、东北话、陕西话、山东话、台普、英语、日语和韩语，并能按文本判断音色；也可发送随机示例台词。适合希望在 QQ 会话中发送多语言语音的 DSH 用户。Edge TTS 失败时可启用百度或有道备用合成，备用服务会收到待合成文本；代码未声明 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:26-41","lib/index.js:191-239","lib/index.js:286-331"]}
{"unit_id":"ENDDREAM-ZM__dsh-qq-voice#card-en","repo":"ENDDREAM-ZM/dsh-qq-voice","commit":"f870405ea35856ba8bb82a4549e5cb7dabdd3a79","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-qq-voice uses OneBot v11 to send synthesized QQ voice messages. It supports Mandarin, Cantonese, regional dialects, Taiwanese Mandarin, English, Japanese, and Korean, with text based voice selection and sample lines. Baidu or Youdao may receive text for fallback synthesis if Edge TTS fails.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:26-41","lib/index.js:191-239","lib/index.js:286-331"]}
