{"unit_id":"ENDDREAM-ZM__dsh-qq-voice#readme-10","repo":"ENDDREAM-ZM/dsh-qq-voice","commit":"f870405ea35856ba8bb82a4549e5cb7dabdd3a79","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-voice README · 已知边界：- 语音条会被 QQ 转成 silk（单声道 ~24kbps），想保原音质请用点歌插件的 `sendMode: file`；\n- Edge TTS 偶发限流，插件会自动换百度 / 有道，音色会变成\"通用女声\"；\n- 中文断句靠 Edge 自己，长句想停顿就用逗号。\n\n---\n\n<!-- siblings -->","source":"extracted","section":"已知边界"}
